3.0 s. The first-order skill uses this to compare designs.\n• 3.0 s is the faster system.\n• \\(0.95\\tau=3.8\\ \\mathrm{s}\\) assumes a linear rise.","preview":["first-order-sys"],"figure":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two normalized first-order step responses: a fast one with tau = 1 s (solid) and a slow one with tau = 4 s (dashed).\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" style=\"max-width:340px;width:100%;height:auto\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"176\"/><polygon points=\"330,176 323.6,178.7 323.6,173.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"16\"/><polygon points=\"50,16 52.7,22.4 47.3,22.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">t (s)</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">y / y∞</text><polyline points=\"50,176 52.2,159 54.5,144.1 56.8,131 59,119.6 61.2,109.6 63.5,100.9 65.8,93.3 68,86.6 70.2,80.7 72.5,75.6 74.8,71.1 77,67.2 79.2,63.7 81.5,60.7 83.8,58.1 86,55.8 88.2,53.8 90.5,52 92.8,50.5 95,49.1 97.2,47.9 99.5,46.9 101.8,46 104,45.2 106.2,44.5 108.5,43.9 110.8,43.4 113,42.9 115.2,42.5 117.5,42.1 119.8,41.8 122,41.5 124.2,41.3 126.5,41.1 128.8,40.9 131,40.8 133.2,40.6 135.5,40.5 137.8,40.4 140,40.3 142.2,40.2 144.5,40.1 146.8,40.1 149,40 151.2,40 153.5,39.9 155.8,39.9 158,39.9 160.2,39.8 162.5,39.8 164.8,39.8 167,39.8 169.2,39.8 171.5,39.7 173.8,39.7 176,39.7 178.2,39.7 180.5,39.7 182.8,39.7 185,39.7 187.2,39.7 189.5,39.7 191.8,39.7 194,39.7 196.2,39.7 198.5,39.7 200.8,39.7 203,39.7 205.2,39.7 207.5,39.6 209.8,39.6 212,39.6 214.2,39.6 216.5,39.6 218.8,39.6 221,39.6 223.2,39.6 225.5,39.6 227.8,39.6 230,39.6 232.2,39.6 234.5,39.6 236.8,39.6 239,39.6 241.2,39.6 243.5,39.6 245.8,39.6 248,39.6 250.2,