ans large overshoot.\n• \\(e^{-\\pi\\zeta}=0.54\\) drops the \\(\\sqrt{1-\\zeta^2}\\) factor; close here, but wrong for heavier damping.\n• Overshoot is measured relative to the final value 1, not to 26.","preview":["step-specs"],"figure":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Second-order step response; a dashed line marks the final value 1 and the first peak is well above it.\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" style=\"max-width:340px;width:100%;height:auto\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"176\"/><polygon points=\"330,176 323.6,178.7 323.6,173.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"16\"/><polygon points=\"50,16 52.7,22.4 47.3,22.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">t (s)</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">y(t)</text><polyline points=\"50,176 52.2,173.3 54.5,165.9 56.8,155.8 59,140.3 61.2,124.4 63.5,109.6 65.8,93.6 68,77.6 70.2,65.3 72.5,55.8 74.8,49.3 77,46.2 79.2,45.8 81.5,48 83.8,53.4 86,60.2 88.2,68.2 90.5,76.9 92.8,85.6 95,93.8 97.2,101.1 99.5,107 101.8,111 104,113.9 106.2,115.1 108.5,114.6 110.8,112.6 113,109.9 115.2,105.6 117.5,101.1 119.8,96.4 122,91.8 124.2,88 126.5,84.1 128.8,81.2 131,79.3 133.2,78.2 135.5,78.1 137.8,78.7 140,80 142.2,81.7 144.5,84.2 146.8,86.6 149,89.1 151.2,91.5 153.5,93.4 155.8,95.3 158,96.5 160.2,97.5 162.5,97.8 164.8,97.7 167,97.2 169.2,96.4 171.5,95.3 173.8,94 176,92.8 178.2,91.4 180.5,90.2 182.8,89.1 185,88.3 187.2,87.7 189.5,87.4 191.8,87.3 194,87.4 196.2,87.8 198.5,88.2 200.8,88.9 203,89.6 205.2,90.3 207.5,91 209.8,91.6 212,92.1 214.2,92.5 216.5,92.8 218.8,92.9 221,92.9 223.2,92.7 225.5,92.5 227.8,92.2 230,91.9 232.2,91.5 234.5,91.1 236.8,90.8 239,90.5 241.2,9